script = ExtResource("1_6pl46")
dialogue_id = "debate_dragon_mine"
record_title = "Debate Speech: Sacred Inscriptions"
text = "PAGE: historian(PORTAL_NETWORK), AUDIENCE
historian: You have all heard of the Ember monks.
historian: For generations, they have built their monasteries on the volcanoes and revered the dragon spirits said to dwell within the magma chambers.
historian: The Grand Accord itself was inspired by inscriptions found in these caves.
historian: But now that we better understand the ancient language, it is time to reevaluate these inscriptions.
historian: \"Unstable load-bearing pillars.\"
historian: \"Toxic fumes. Do not breathe.\"
historian: \"Verify magma pressure before excavation.\"
historian: This is all wise advice, yes, but words of a divine spirit they are not.
historian: We are quick to dress up our own ignorance in the robes of divinity.
historian: A ruin we do not understand must be a holy temple.
historian: A disaster we didn't foresee must be divine will.
historian: It is easier to bow before a grand mystery than to patiently unearth mundane truth.
historian: If we keep hoping for supernatural salvation, we will stop working on real solutions."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://jtkfcsyiryo4"
